    "verification": "Free plan advertises no credit card; paid upgrades require billing.",
    "tiers": "Free 30 concurrent jobs; paid plan upgrades offer higher concurrency and custom enterprise options.",
    "notes": "Plan ceiling, not assurance all executor types/hardware are available immediately. Credits and resource-class limits still apply; approval turnaround for special limits unknown.",
